* (''person from east Asia''): [[East Asian]], [[Oriental]], [[Oriental Asian]], [[Chinese]] (''loosely'')
* (''person from the Indian subcontinent''): [[South Asian]], [[Desi]], [[Asian Indian]], [[East Indian]], [[Indian]] (''loosely''), [[Pakistani]] (''loosely'')

